# DIGEST.md IS COMMITTED, DELIBERATELY, AND MUST NOT BE ADDED HERE.
#
# This file used to ignore it as "derived (precomputed cross-scope digest from the memory
# index)". That producer was removed 2026-07-29 and nothing has regenerated the file since,
# so DIGEST.md is now hand-maintained: it holds the notepad's standing caveats, and the
# SessionStart hook injects it alongside NOTES.md on every start.
#
# Ignoring it therefore puts those caveats on ONE machine while every other clone loads
# nothing where they used to be — strictly worse than the overlong NOTES.md the split exists
# to relieve. The rule was not wrong when it was written; it outlived what it described,
# which is the only way this kind of line survives review.
#
# plugin/tests/test_notepad_model.sh asserts DIGEST.md is absent from this file, so
# re-adding it is a test failure rather than a discovery.

# Memory-mirror staging, from the same removed subsystem: `hooks/mirror-guarded.sh` was
# deleted 2026-08-03, so nothing writes this directory any more. Kept as an inert rule
# because it ignores nothing on a current notepad — unlike the line above, which ignored
# something that matters.
.anp-mirror/

# OS / editor cruft
.DS_Store
*.swp
